,"pdp-portfolio-monthly-holdings-table-title":"All Holdings","pdp-portfolio-delta-gamma-table-title":" Supplemental Information","pdp-portfolio-delta-gamma-column-header1":"Security ID","pdp-portfolio-delta-gamma-column-header2":"Security Name","pdp-portfolio-delta-gamma-column-header3":"Estimated Equivalent Unit Delta","pdp-portfolio-delta-gamma-column-header4":"Estimated Equivalent Unit Gamma","pdp-portfolio-delta-gamma-column-header5":"DeltaGamma Reference Price","pdp-portfolio-delta-gamma-column-header6":"DeltaGamma Reference Time","pdp-portfolio-delta-gamma-excel-filename":"JPM Equity Linked Notes Estimated Equivalent Unit Delta-Gamma","pdp-portfolio-delta-gamma-excel-button-label":"Download ELN Data","pdp-portfolio-delta-gamma-excel-sheet-name":"ELN DATA","since-inception":"Since Inception","dropdown-custom-date-range":"Custom Date Range","fx-no-funds":"There are no funds that match the criteria you have specified.","fd-title":"Fund Documents","fd-title-upper":"FUND DOCUMENTS","fd-view-doc":"VIEW DOCS","fd-bottom-disclosure":"For additional mutual fund and exchange traded fund data (such as sector / industry / country / regional / fund allocations of sources of value add, maturity / quality / market capitalization allocations) not currently shown on individual Fund webpages or the Fund Factsheet, please call JPM Shareholder Services desk at 1-800-480-4111. Information will be available no sooner than 5 business days after quarter- or month-end and available fund data will vary by fund. Verification of existing investment will be required.","fd-no-funds":"There are no funds that match the criteria you have specified.","fd-no-data-for-filter":"No results found for {SEARCHTEXT}.<br/>Your filter selections may be eliminating some results.","fx-funds-table-column-header-shareClassInceptionDate":"{fundType, select, SMA {INCEPTION} other {CLASS INCEPTION}}","fx-funds-table-column-header-displayName":"{fundType, select, 529Plans {PORTFOLIO NAME} Alternatives {PRODUCT NAME} SMA {STRATEGY NAME} other {FUND NAME}}","fx-funds-table-column-header-nav":"NAV ($)","fx-new-york-529-advisor":"New York 529 Advisor","fx-future-path-529-plan":"Future Path 529 Plan","pdp-fund-documents-redirect":"This fund is no longer available. You will be redirected to Funds Document Page in 3 seconds.","portfolio-manager-insight-card-title":"Insights from the Portfolio Manager","pdp-documents-fact-sheet-label":"Fact Sheet","pdp-documents-fund-literature-label-sma":"Strategy Literature","pdp-documents-fund-literature-banner-disclosure":"Get notified when updated literature is available","pdp-overview-esg-integrated-approach-label":"ESG Approach","pdp-overview-esg-integrated-card-title":"Integrated","pdp-overview-esg-integrated-card-esgBestInClassFlag":"Best In Class","pdp-overview-esg-integrated-card-esgThemeBasedFlag":"Thematic","pdp-overview-esg-integrated-card-content":"This fund considers financially material Environmental, Social and Governance (ESG) factors in investment analysis and investment decisions, with the goal of enhancing long-term, risk-adjusted financial returns.","pdp-overview-esg-integrated-card-BestInClass-content":"An investment style that focuses on companies / issuers that lead their peer groups in respect of sustainability performance.","pdp-overview-esg-integrated-card-ThemeBased-content":"Investments in themes or assets specifically related to sustainability.","pdp-overview-esg-integrated-card-learn-more":"Learn more about ESG Integration","pdp-overview-esg-integrated-card-learn-more-approach-flag":"Learn more about sustainable investing approaches","esg-integrated-sfdr-article-6":"Article 6","esg-integrated-sfdr-article-8":"Article 8","esg-integrated-sfdr-article-9":"Article 9","management-style-a":"Active","management-style-p":"Passive (including Factors)","management-style-active-management-style":"A","management-style-passive-management-style":"P","fx-filter-by-management-style-label":"MANAGEMENT STYLE","pdp-excel-shares-holdings-label":"-Holdings-","pdp-excel-shares-proxy-holdings-label":"-Proxy-Holdings-","pdp-excel-disclosures-holdings":"Holdings and allocations shown above are un-audited, and may not be representative of current or future investments. The above holdings list has been created from the books and records of the Fund without examination by independent auditors.~~~Fund holdings should not be relied on in making investment decisions and should not be construed as research or investment advice regarding particular securities. The above holdings are shown for informational purposes only and not intended as~~~an offer or solicitation with respect to the purchase or sale of any security. The uncertified holdings do not include all derivatives.","pdp-download-data-button-label":"Download all daily holdings","fx-performance-return-row-nav":"{fundType, select, sma {Gross of Fees} other {at Nav}}","fx-performance-return-row-sales-charge":"{fundType, select, sma {Net of Fees} other {with Sales Charge}}","pdp-custom-date-range-date-from-label":"From","pdp-custom-date-range-date-to-label":"To","pdp-perf-chart-date-from-label":"From","pdp-perf-chart-date-to-label":"To","pdp-perf-chart-date-range-label":"Date Range","pdp-perf-chart-approx-value-label":"Approx Value ","pdp-perf-chart-initial-amount-label":"Initial Amount","pdp-perf-chart-regular-saving-amount-label":"Regular Savings Amount","pdp-perf-chart-approx-percent-label":"Approx % ","pdp-perf-chart-header-label":"{fundType, select, SMA {Growth of an Investment (over Time)} other {Growth of Hypothetical Investment}}","pdp-ic-btn-compare-this-investment":"Compare this fund","pdp-ic-btn-compare-fund-intro-text":"Get an instant comparison of this fund with over 35,000 investments","pdp-cta-subscribe-to-product-literature-badge":"NEW","pdp-cta-subscribe-to-product-literature":"Get notified when updated literature is available","ic-cta-create-account-text":"Create a free account for access to all features & data","ic-cta-create-account-button-text":"Create account >","ic-performance-return-label":"Return","ic-performance-morningstar-title":"Performance & Morningstar Ranks","ic-performance-morningstar-disclosure":"<strong><em>Performance quoted is past performance and is no guarantee of future results. Investment returns and principal value will fluctuate, so shares, when sold, may be worth more or less than original cost. Current performance may be higher or lower than returns shown. Call 1-800-480-4111 for most recent month-end performance.</em></strong><br><br>Total return figures (for the fund) does not include any sales charges, assume payment of fees and reinvestment of dividends (after the highest applicable foreign withholding tax) and distributions. Without fee waivers, fund returns would have been lower. Due to rounding, some values may not total 100%. Annualized except when performance period is less than one year.<br><br>The ranking information is provided by Morningstar. Rankings are calculated based upon the total returns of multiple share classes within their respective Morningstar category. Different share classes may have different rankings.<br><br>","ic-performance-morningstar-popup-disclosure":"<div id='ic-performance-popup-disclosure' class='ic-performance-popup-disclosure'> <span>Top Quartile</span><span class='background-inch-worm'>0%-25%</span> <span class='background-jasmin'>26%-50%</span> <span class='background-rajah'>51%-75%</span> <span class='background-tulip'>76%-100%</span> <span>Bottom Quartile</span> </div>","ic-statistics-title":"Statistics","ic-growth-of-10k-title":"Growth of $10k","ic-cta-second-right":"<div><ul><li>Run a free analysis in seconds</li><li>Compare upto 6 investments</li><li>Get advanced performance & risk data</li><li>Stress tests in various market events</li><li>Download user-friendly reports customized with your own branding</li></ul></div>","ic-cta-second-col1-row1":"Compare up to 6 investments from over 35,000 options","ic-cta-second-col1-row2":"Advanced data including something about this here","ic-cta-second-col2-row1":"Stress test funds in various market events","ic-cta-second-col2-row2":"Access to proprietary research from Dr. David Kelly","ic-cta-second-col3-row1":"Download client-ready reports of your analyses","ic-cta-second-col3-row2":"Customize reports with your company branding","ic-cta-second-header":"See the full analysis in our free Investment Comparison tool","ic-cta-second-description":"It’s free, simply log in or create an account for instant access to all advanced data & customization features.","ic-cta-second-download":"Download a sample analysis","ic-cta-login-to-continue":"Log in to continue","ic-cta-sign-up":"Sign up","ic-cta-continue-to-full-analysis":"Continue to full analysis","ic-lite-growth-10k-download-sheet-name":"Growth of Hypothetical Inv.","ic-lite-growth-10k-download-title":"Growth of $10k (AS OF ","ic-lite-growth-10k-download-date-header":"Date","ic-lite-growth-10k-download-approx-value-header":"Approx. Value ($)","ic-lite-growth-10k-download-file-name":"Growth of 10K ","ic-lite-growth-10k-download-file-name-as-of":"(AS-OF-","ic-lite-growth-10k-download-disclaimer-line-1":"The Growth of Hypothetical Investment chart download does not assume the max sales charge (if any), which would lower returns. It includes reinvestment of dividends and gains. Expenses were deducted. Performance for other share classes will vary.","ic-lite-growth-10k-download-disclaimer-line-2":"The performance quoted represents past performance and does not guarantee future results.","ic-lite-growth-10k-download-disclaimer-line-3":"Since inception at NAV. Past performance is not indicative of future results.","ic-lite-growth-10k-download-disclaimer-line-4":"The quoted performance of the Fund includes performance of a predecessor fund/share class prior to the Fund's commencement of operations. Please refer to the current prospectus for further information.","fx-fund-type-alternatives":"Alternatives","pdp-ic-fund-text":"Compare {ticker} with other investments","pdp-ic-fund-search-cancel":"Cancel","pdp-ic-fund-search-label":"Search investments","pdp-ic-fund-search-placeholder-ticker":"Type ticker or investment name","pdp-excel-disclosures-proxy-holdings-1":"This ETF is different from traditional ETFs. Traditional ETFs tell the public what assets they hold each day. This ETF will not. This may create additional risks for your investment. Specifically:~~~ 1) You may have to pay more money to trade the ETF’s shares. This ETF will provide less information to traders, who tend to charge more for trades when they have less information,~~~ 2) The price you pay to buy ETF shares on exchange may not match the value of the ETF’s portfolio. The same is true when you sell shares. These price differences may be greater for this ETF compared to other ETFs because it provides less information to traders,~~~ 3) these additional risks may be even greater in bad or uncertain market conditions, and ~~~4) The ETF will publish, on its website each day, a “Proxy Portfolio” designed to help trading in shares of the ETF. While the Proxy Portfolio includes some of the ETF’s holdings, it is not the ETF’s actual portfolio.","pdp-excel-disclosures-proxy-holdings-2":"The differences between this ETF and other ETFs may also have advantages. By keeping certain information about the ETF secret, this ETF may face less risk that other traders can predict or copy its investment strategy. This may improve the ETF’s performance.~~~ If other traders are able to copy or predict the ETF’s investment strategy, however, this may hurt the ETF’s performance. Please see the ETF’s prospectus for additional information regarding the unique attributes and risks of the ETF.","pdp-excel-disclosures-proxy-holdings-3":"J.P. Morgan Funds and J.P. Morgan ETFs are distributed by JPMorgan Distribution Services, Inc., which is an affiliate of JPMorgan Chase & Co. Affiliates of JPMorgan Chase & Co. receive fees for providing various services to the funds. JPMorgan Distribution Services, Inc. is a member of FINRA","pdp-excel-disclosures-proxy-holdings-4":"Must be preceded or accompanied by a prospectus.","pdp-excel-disclosures-proxy-holdings-5":"JPMorganChase & Co. 2022.","pdp-daily-proxy-holdings-download-button-pdf":"Download all proxy holdings (PDF)","pdp-daily-proxy-holdings-download-button-xls":"Download all proxy holdings (XLS)","pdp-ic-fund-overview-title":"Overview","pdp-ic-fund-overview-disclosure-text-1":"The difference between gross and net expense ratios are due to contractual and/or voluntary waivers if applicable. The manager may agree to voluntarily waive certain fees and expenses, which the manager can discontinue at any time. Please see each funds’ prospectus for additional information.<br><br>Asset Class source is J.P. Morgan Asset Management based on Morningstar’s Global Broad Category Group.<br><br>Overall Morningstar RatingTM for a fund is derived from a weighted average of the performance figures associated with its three-, five-, and 10-year (if applicable) Morningstar Rating metrics. For investments selected the detailed Morningstar Ratings/Funds in Category are as follows: <strong><br><br>","pdp-ic-fund-overview-disclosure-text-2":"</strong><br><br>The Morningstar RatingTM for funds, or \"star rating\", is calculated for managed products (including mutual funds, variable annuity and variable life subaccounts, exchange-traded funds, closed-end funds, and separate accounts) with at least a three-year history. Exchange traded funds and open-ended mutual funds are considered a single population for comparative purposes. It is calculated based on a Morningstar Risk-Adjusted Return measure that accounts for variation in a managed product's monthly excess performance, placing more emphasis on downward variations and rewarding consistent performance. The top 10% of products in each product category receive 5 stars, the next 22.5% receive 4 stars, the next 35% receive 3 stars, the next 22.5% receive 2 stars, and the bottom 10% receive 1 star. The Overall Morningstar Rating for a managed product is derived from a weighted average of the performance figures associated with its three-, five-, and 10-year (if applicable) Morningstar Rating metrics. The weights are: 100% three-year rating for 36-59 months of total returns, 60% five-year rating/40% three-year rating for 60-119 months of total returns, and 50% 10- year rating/30% five-year rating/20% three-year rating for 120 or more months of total returns. While the 10-year overall star rating formula seems to give the most weight to the 10-year period, the most recent three-year period actually has the greatest impact because it is included in all three rating periods. Rankings do not take sales loads into account.<br><br>","pdp-ic-growth-of-hypo-disclosure-text":"The Growth of Hypothetical Investment chart does not assume the max sales charge (if any), which would lower returns. It includes reinvestment of dividends and gains. Expenses were deducted. Performance for other share classes will vary. The performance quoted represents past performance and does not guarantee future results.<br><br>Since inception at NAV. Past performance is not indicative of future results.<br><br>The quoted performance of the Fund includes performance of a predecessor fund/share class prior to the Fund's commencement of operations. Please refer to the current prospectus for further information.<br><br>","pdp-ic-statistics-disclosure-text":"30-day SEC Yield: Represents net investment income earned by a fund over a 30-day period, expressed as an annual percentage rate based on the fund's share price at the end of the 30-day period. The 30-day yield should be regarded as an estimate of investment income and may not equal the fund's actual income distribution rate.<br><br>12-month yield is the sum of a fund's total trailing 12-month interest and dividend payments divided by the last month's ending share price (NAV) plus any capital gains distributed over the same period.<br><br>Standard Deviation measures the range of an investment's performance. The greater the standard deviation, the greater the investment's volatility.<br><br>Sharpe Ratio indicates the reward per unit of risk by using standard deviation and excess return. The higher the Sharpe ratio, the better the investment's historical risk-adjusted performance.<br><br>","fx-commingled-attestation":"<div tabindex='0'><p>You are attempting to enter the <b>Commingled Pension Trust Fund page</b> which is intended exclusively for U.S. qualified retirement and governmental plans.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The JPMorgan Chase Bank, N.A. (“JPMCB”) Commingled Pension Trust Funds (the \"Commingled Funds\") are collective investment funds managed by JPMCB under a Declaration of Trust and JPMCB makes day-to-day investment decisions for the Commingled Funds.&nbsp; Each Commingled Fund is a group trust within the meaning of Internal Revenue Service Ruling 81-100, as amended.&nbsp; In reliance upon exemptions from the registration requirement of the federal securities laws, neither the Commingled Funds nor the Units of a Commingled Fund are registered with the Securities and Exchange Commission or any state securities commission.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Because the Commingled Funds are not subject to registration under federal or state securities laws, certain protections that might otherwise be provided to investors in registered funds are not available to investors in the Commingled Funds.&nbsp; However, as bank-sponsored collective investment funds holding qualified retirement plan assets, the Commingled Funds are required to comply with applicable provisions of the Employee Retirement Income Security Act of 1974, as amended, and JPMCB is subject to supervision and regulation by the Office of the Comptroller of the Currency and the Department of Labor.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Commingled Funds are only available to certain qualified retirement plans and governmental plans and are not offered to the general public.&nbsp; Units of the Commingled Funds are not bank deposits and are not insured or guaranteed by any bank, government entity, the FDIC or any other type of deposit insurance.&nbsp; You should carefully consider the investment objectives, risk, charges, and expenses of the Commingled Fund(s) before investing.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In addition, in order for a retirement plan to invest in a Commingled Fund, an authorized plan fiduciary must complete and return all necessary participation materials and other required documentation to the trustee (JPMCB or its authorized representative) and specifically authorize and direct the investment of plan assets in a Commingled Fund.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The information provided on this website is for informational purposes only, does not constitute individual investment advice, and is not intended to be, and should not be interpreted as, an investment recommendation.</p></div>","fx-invalid-fundtype":"<div class='error-header'><h1>We're sorry</h1></div><div class='error-line'><p>The page you were trying to reach wasn’t found.</p><p>Please try again later or search our site.</p><p><a href='https://am.jpmorgan.com/<COUNTRYCODE>/<LANGCODE>/asset-management/<ROLECODE>/' class='font-peacock-blue'>Visit our homepage</a></p></div>","fx-service-error":"<div class='error-header'><h1>We're sorry</h1></div><div class='error-line'><p>The page you were trying to reach wasn’t found.</p><p>Please try again later or search our site.</p><p><a href='https://am.jpmorgan.com/<COUNTRYCODE>/<LANGCODE>/asset-management/<ROLECODE>/' class='font-peacock-blue'>Visit our homepage</a></p></div>","pdp-edpi-service-error":"<div class='error-header'><h1>We're sorry</h1></div><div class='error-line'><p>The page you were trying to reach wasn’t found.</p><p>Please try again later or search our site.</p><p><a href='https://am.jpmorgan.com/<COUNTRYCODE>/<LANGCODE>/asset-management/<ROLECODE>/' class='font-peacock-blue'>Visit our homepage</a></p></div>","pdp-edpi-service-error-access-funds":"<div class='error-header'><h1>We're sorry</h1></div><div class='error-line'><p>The page you were trying to reach wasn’t found.</p><p>Please try again later or search our site.</p><p><a href='https://am.jpmorgan.com/<COUNTRYCODE>/<LANGCODE>/asset-management/<ROLECODE>/' class='font-peacock-blue'>Visit our homepage</a></p></div>","pdp-cusip-no-data":"<div class='error-header'><h1>We're sorry</h1></div><div class='error-line'><p>The page you were trying to reach wasn't found.</p><p>Please try again later or search our site.</p><p><a href='https://am.jpmorgan.com/<COUNTRYCODE>/<LANGCODE>/asset-management/<ROLECODE>/' class='font-peacock-blue'>Visit our homepage</a></p></div>","pdp-cusip-no-data-access-funds":"<div class='error-header'><h1>We're sorry</h1></div><div class='error-line'><p>The page you were trying to reach wasn't found.</p><p>Please try again later or search our site.</p><p><a href='https://am.jpmorgan.com/<COUNTRYCODE>/<LANGCODE>/asset-management/<ROLECODE>/' class='font-peacock-blue'>Visit our homepage</a></p></div>","pdp-etf-doc-label-AR":"Annual Financial Statements","pdp-etf-doc-label-SAR":"Semi-Annual Financial Statements","pdp-etf-doc-label-PR":"Annual Management Report of Fund Performance (MRFP)","pdp-etf-doc-label-FSD":"Semi-Annual Management Report of Fund Performance (MRFP)","pdp-etf-doc-label-IS":"Annual IRC Report to Securityholders","pdp-etf-doc-label-P":"Prospectus","pdp-etf-doc-label-FS":"ETF Facts","pdp-etf-doc-label-QR":"Quarterly Portfolio Disclosure","etf-nav-market-price-year-PY":"Prior Year {year} (Jan 1 – Dec 31)","etf-nav-market-price-year-Q1":"Q1 {year} (Jan 1 – Mar 31)","etf-nav-market-price-year-Q2":"Q2 {year} (Apr 1 – Jun 30)","etf-nav-market-price-year-Q3":"Q3 {year} (Jul 1 – Sep 30)","pdp-summary-header-morningstar-data-coverage-percentage-label":"Data Coverage %: "}
